WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Select the part and enter anchor editing

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Place anchors around the interface

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. Select the target you want to change

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.042
Motion replay: move one target; balance the other anchors without stretching the block.

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:14.042
4. Move one target and judge the compromise

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:17.042
5. Accept the pose as the next baseline
